window.products.push({"id":209046,"name":"BEYOND BREEZE NTEC Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier,4L Premium Humidifier for Bedroom,Large Room, Quiet Operation, LED Touch Display, Remote Control, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616u0j3PUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL MIST HUMIDIFIER - Ultrasonic humidifier provides cool mist for you to breathe easily and sleep comfortably. Cool mist keep you fresh from hot and sticky weather. Cool mist humidifier is perfect for all year round using, essential for bedroom, home, office. ADJUSTABLE MIST - Mist outlet is 360° rotable. For air Humidifier with multiple settings for mist level and timer, you can customize the mist level to the space and the weather by selecting your ideal misting speed, and setting the timer on 1-12 hours. Enjoy the fresh air and keep healthy in the room QUIET & COMFORTABLE - Ultrasonic humidifier for bedroom with quiet operation can give you a full night of sleep, is the ideal humidifier for bedrooms. Besides, the sleep mode option allows your to turn off all the lights for deeper sleep, it is perfect for babies, kids, seniors and sensitive sleepers. CONVENIENT OPERATION - The remote of mist humidifier for home gives you control over all settings - mist levels,humidity levels, times, sleep mode. Informative LED display tells you the current RH and time you set. Touch the power switch, ultrasonic humidifier starts working, night light on, mist indicator bar together with blue mist quantity icon will light gradually. HUMIDIFYING WITH SAFETY - The cool mist humidifier automatically shuts down when out of water. This helps prevents damage to the unit and keeps you protected. We took extreme care when designing our room humidifier, and back it up by meeting the highest safety standards. The power cord and all electrical components are ETL certified","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616u0j3PUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEYOND BREEZE","source_asin":"B08Y1QBLGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y1QBLGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y1QBLGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209047,"name":"Feng Shui Black Obsidian Pi Yao Pi Xiu Car Wall Charm Hanging Tassel for Wealth Luck","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zx6UEsdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pi Xiu is a good luck creature, and it is the ninth son of the Heavenly Dragon whose task is to provide the blessings of good finance and wealth. A very fascinating fact about this lucky creature is that it does not have an anus, so that, despite its never-ending appetite, things go in yet never come out. This is a unique symbolism, indicating that money will come to you but never leave. The Pi Yao is found in many places, such as banks, casinos, and finance companies - anything that has to do with a benefit from monetary gain. Since ancient times, when it served to safeguard the homes of emperors and government officials, the Chinese have always admired and respected this extremely good luck symbol. It is a very loyal creature, and will always attempt to rid its owners life of bad luck and replace it with wealth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zx6UEsdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Betterdecor","source_asin":"B0066ZTLEO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0066ZTLEO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0066ZTLEO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209048,"name":"Freshware 24-Cavity Volcano Shape Silicone Mold for Mini Cake, Bread, Tart, Cheesecake, Pudding, Jello, and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJAiI7OtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create your own special desserts or homemade soaps with the Freshware CB-217RD 24-Cavity Silicone Mini Volcano Muffin, Brownie, Cornbread, Cheesecake, Panna Cotta, Pudding and Jello Shot Mold. This mold is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the baked goods to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Mold Size: 11.7 x 6.8 x 1.3 inch. Cavity Size: 1.4 inch top x 0.6 inch bottom diameter x 1.3 depth. Volume: 24 x 0.5 oz, Total 12 oz. Many customers have found creative ways to use Freshware silicone molds (depending upon the shape) to create delicious homemade cupcakes, muffins, brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, quiches, breads, chocolates, candies, tarts, butters, caramels, ice cubes, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oJAiI7OtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B00405YG7O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00405YG7O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00405YG7O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
