window.products.push({"id":209109,"name":"Cow Print Blanket Plush Blanket Cozy Blanket for All-Season, Super Soft Throws with Cute Pattern for Daughter Adults Students Teen, Brown, 50\"x60\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RvufbWL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨Soft and Lightweight Material: Made of high quality flannel fleece microfiber polyester, which is super softness, warm, breathable, plush and durable. The cow print stuff will provide breathability & warmth, make you feel soft and comfortable. The cow blankets use double-stitched along the lengths and layers to stay soft and new after multiple washes. No pilling, no fading, no shrinking, no sheeding. ✨Perfect for All-seasons and Place: The blankets can be used for indoor and outdoor for all-seasons. Such as, bed & sofa & couch layers movie theater, car seat, park, farmhouse, picnic spot, lounging, camping, travelling. The warm blanket is not only perfect for summer sleep, but also warm enough for winter. Will give you excellent experience. In addition, it also gives your house a unique decorative and modern look as cow decor. ✨Two Color & Various Size: You can choose black or brown blanket and the right size according to your needs. Small-40 x 50 in(100x130cm), suitable for baby swaddle and kids nap; Medium-50 x 60 in(130 x 150cm), good as outdoor blanket, travel blanket, sofa blanket and office blanket, lightweight and convenient to bring; Large-60 x 80 in(150 x 200cm), the big size is perfect for bed to use. The bed throw blanket can add a little flair to your room or an extra layer of warmth! ✨Great Gift Idea: Perfect gifts for any occasion like Mother's Day, Father's Day, housewarming, Valentine's Day and other holidays, best friend's birthday. Good for the people who love this farm and enjoy farmhouse decor. The cow print bedding is a multifunctional blanket as bed blanket, shawl blanket, air-conditional blanket, nap blanket, kids blanket, travelling blanket, and so on. ✨Easy to Clean: The couch blanket can hand wash, also compatible with machine washer, save your time in daily life. Wash on the gentle cycle without destroying the fiber structure. Please avoid prolonged exposure to the sun and just dry in a cool, ventilated place. If any problem, you can directly contact us and we will try out best to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RvufbWL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Awaytail","source_asin":"B0BBF273GX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBF273GX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBF273GX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
