window.products.push({"id":209175,"name":"FASHIONCRAFT 5\" Stunning Tapestry Fabric Eyeglass Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1psgL0jofL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of looking through scratched and bent eyeglasses keep them protected in our luxurious fleece lined holder. There is nothing worse than trying to read your latest novel through eyeglasses that are bent and scratched. Simply putting them down on a hard surface is enough to cause irreparable damage. Our plush eyeglass holder stands upright on a desk, a night stand or a dresser and offers a tip proof design. It is beautifully covered with a classic tapestry design that will perfectly compliment a room with a vintage themed decor. The holder is lined with a glorious soft fleecy protective inner. They make a perfect impulse gift for someone wanting to spoil herself. They also make fabulous presents and classy event favors, giving you the best of all options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1psgL0jofL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASHIONCRAFT","source_asin":"B014G9LJEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014G9LJEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014G9LJEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209176,"name":"Kobi Blocks Walnut Edge Grain Butcher Block Wood Cutting Board 14\" x 18\" x 1\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Hp3SCRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your kitchen by adding a custom made Butcher Block Cutting Board. Easily one of our most popular blocks, you can’t go wrong with this old world styling and rustic charm. The block truly brings out the beauty in simplicity. Manufacturing Process All the wood used is purchased from a local mill here in the Smoky Mountains. All Tennessee Butcher Blocks are manufactured with precision machinery using all natural products to balance making your board unique, while maintaining the highest standards in each step of our planeing, ripping, adhesion, measuring, cutting, sanding and oiling processes. We are a husband and wife team and we make each order as they come in, ensuring that every board is fresh cut and newly crafted just for you! Design We strive to bring an artistic quality to every board we make so your piece can seamlessly fit in as a contemporary, yet rustic, homey and warm piece of décor when not in use. Is there a special occasion coming up in your life? Tennessee Butcher Blocks make the perfect gift for Mother’s or Father’s day, Valentine’s Day, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Weddings, Christmas, Hanukkah, Housewarming gifts and many other traditional occasions. Other sites can take weeks to get your board out; whereas we can get it to you in days! Since our boards are made from all natural healthy wood products, and not from chemically plagued plastic products, Tennessee Butcher Blocks require minimal, but needed maintenance to help keep your board in good condition. Our maintenance guide comes complimentary with every piece. Our Promise We stand behind our products and make every board to last a lifetime with proper maintenance for each and every Tennessee Butcher Block we sell, in hopes that your Block will be a part of your family and home for generations. Best of all; ALL Tennessee Butcher Blocks are 100% MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Hp3SCRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kobi Blocks","source_asin":"B00LDKJ1PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LDKJ1PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LDKJ1PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
