window.products.push({"id":209261,"name":"Bamboo Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer with Modern Marble Wrap Finish, Storage Holder for Plastic Food Bags, Sandwich, Quart, Snack, and Gallon Sized Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1f0jUOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store and Organize Multiple Food Saver Plastic Bags with an All-in-One Bag Storage Holder If you’re like most people, you always have a need for plastic food bags. And be it packing a school lunch for your kids, storing leftovers after dinner, or keeping a few snacks handy when you’re stuck at work all day, you want an easy way to keep all those differently sized bags organized while making more room in your kitchen drawers. We created the Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer as a simple, effective, and accessible way to keep four different bags sizes handy, while also minimizing the clutter in your kitchen. Product Details: All-in-One Bamboo Ziplock Bag Organizer Stores Quart, Snack, Sandwich, and Gallon Bags Elegant Marble Wrap Finish (Over Bamboo Frame) Compact Space Saver for Drawers and Pantries Universal Brand Compatibility Dimensions:11.61W” x 12.60H” x 2.95Depth” (inches) Clean Marble Finish The marble look gives our storage bag organizer a more professional, sophisticated look that pairs well with modern kitchens, which helps it blend in with your kitchen decor and design. Improve Daily Access From putting together quick lunches in the morning to packing a few snacks before those long car rides this all-in-one organizer makes it easier to grab and use bags in a pinch. Minimize the Cardboard Clutter Sustainable, convenience, and accessibility are all important for today’s kitchens. That’s because our time is valuable, and we need to make things easier even in the smallest ways. These food bag storage boxes minimize the big, bulkiness of cardboard bag boxes, so you can streamline things just a little bit more every day. Store or Display It Anywhere The real versatility in our Ziplock storage bag holder is that it looks great on the counter, fits in deep kitchen drawers, and sits perfectly on pantry shelves. This means you can keep it handy wherever you prepare meals, store leftovers, or want to make plastic food bags more accessible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1f0jUOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09V1XJ8J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V1XJ8J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V1XJ8J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
