window.products.push({"id":209301,"name":"MyMesken Turkish Hand Towels - Hand Woven Turkish Cotton, Quick Dry & Highly Absorbent to Reduce Water Consumption | Eco Friendly Turkish Towel for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hu-XpS4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOT ALL TURKISH HAND TOWELS SETS ARE THE SAME: MyMesken eco friendly towels are made with no harmful substances and include high quality, hand woven, 100% Turkish cotton. Our Pesthemal hand towels measure 40” x 18” (larger than regular hand towels) and include a unique, modern ruffle tassel design that pairs elegantly with any decor. 2. REDUCE WATER & ENERGY CONSUMPTION: My Mesken had 4 main benefits in mind when developing our Turkish linen hand towels: quick dry, highly absorbent, easy to carry, and lightweight. By doing so successfully, you get to live stress free knowing you are reducing your water and energy consumption while also not having to worry about that mildewy smell of regular cotton hand towels when they are wet. 3. VERSATILE DESIGN: MyMesken Turkish washcloths are versatile and can be used to fit a few different needs. Are you looking for bathroom hand towels? Or kitchen hand towels? Maybe just general bathroom decor? A few unique uses are for Turkish tea sets or even as a runner on a small table! The uses are truly endless - will you think of a new one? 4. WASH & DRY INSTRUCTIONS: We recommend a gentle wash with cold water by machine or hand wash. DO NOT use softener or bleach and DO NOT tumble dry. The Turkish cotton hand towels will become softer and more absorbent after several washes. 5. HOUSEWARMING GIFT FOR NEW HOME: With our variety of color options, our Turkish bath towels are perfect for any housewarming gift, or Turkish gift basket to compliment other Turkish house decor. Full color options include: white, black, gray, cream, navy blue, off white, powder pink, and red","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hu-XpS4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyMesken","source_asin":"B0879FHMCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0879FHMCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0879FHMCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
