window.products.push({"id":209350,"name":"HIMOX Air Purifiers for Medium Size bedroom Room,Up to 1086 Sq Ft Large room, Professional Medical HEPA Filtration 99.99% Removal Dust Smoke Mold Poll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":126.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7191zYdm8OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAY GOODBYE TO DIRTY AIR: Have you and your family been bothered by air pollution? H13 HEPA filter air purifier for home pairs with an advanced filtration system. The CADR of 250 m³/h and filters air 5 times per hour for large room up 1086 sq ft. Keep enjoying the healthy and fresh air with your family and friends all the way. 4 IN 1 MEDICAL GRADE H13 HEPA: Pre-filter, true H13 HEPA filter, and activated carbon filtration in one help to remove 99.97% of airborne particles 0.3 microns, such as dust, smoke, pollen, and odor VOCs. This allergies air purifier for smoking perfect choice for allergics, babies, children, the elderly, and others who pay attention to air quality and personal health. ENJOY BETTER SlEEP: Are you troubled by insomnia or light sleep? This essential oils Air Purifiers for Bedroom With Aromatherapy Scent and Quiet Sleep Mode is ture hepa air filter and aromatherapy in one. Add a few drops of your favorite essential oil to help unclog stuffy noses, relieve sore throats, and aid in deeper, more peaceful sleep. Sleep mode runs below 20db prevent disturbing your dreams in a such silent night. SMART AIR QUALITY MONITORING: This air cleaner for smokers include Air Quality Monitor, Smoke Sensor and Filter Check Indicator: Built-in smart sensor to monitor the air quality around your house and display at 3 colors to show the air quality level blue (healthy), green (slightly polluted), red (heavily polluted). In addition, built-in filter check indicator remind to replace the filter to ensure the efficiency of HIMOX H08 air purifier. US Brand & Quality Guarantee & 12 Months Warranty: ETL proved and CARB listed. 100% Ozone free. HIMOX promise that we never using the UVC/ion lights which is harmful to healthy especially for children and asthma sufferers. US company, located Miami & California, providing 24-hour after sale service around the USA. The replacement filter (Search for B0BZD1CMFS on Amazon) lasts 3,000 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7191zYdm8OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIMOX","source_asin":"B0BYSD8CWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYSD8CWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYSD8CWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
