window.products.push({"id":209571,"name":"Sufuhom CertiPUR-US Contour Memory Foam Pillow, Cervical Neck Support Pillows for Head Neck Pain Relief, Ergonomic Sleeping Orthopedic Pillow for Side","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xtw8u7NUL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","description":"👑 【Head Groove Design】Are you boring about back pain when you wake up after a terrible night as no Head Groove Design on your pillow, your body cannot maintain a natural curve when lying? Goodbye to the problem with Sufuhom pillow, it can comfortably support your head and neck, allowing you to maintain a natural sleeping position! It has a Shiatsu massage design that will help your neck and shoulders relax, allowing you to drift off into uninterrupted sleep and wake up feeling fully recharged. 📣 【No More Sore Hands Nor Numb Shoulders】There is no place to put your hands, Do you still sleep with the hands and shoulders pressed as there is no place to put your hands which results in sore hands and numb shoulders. Let the problem end!! You should enjoy comfortable sleep with your hands naturally place in the Arm Placement Area, no matter sleep on your side, back or stomach with Sufuhome contour pillows. 👜 【CertiPUR-US Memory Foam Pillow Effectively Relief Neck and Shoulder Pain】Sufuhom exclusive memory foam core is CertiPUR-US Certified and freshly manufactured instead of using recycled contaminated and unregulated materials to ensure the ultimate quality and producing optimum firmness, not too firm, not too soft. If you have chronic cervical spondylosis, the delicate neck support pillow will be the optimum choice as it provides a comfortable sleep and relieving pain of the cervical vertebra. 💰【Soft, Skin Friendly Inner & Outer Pillowcase with STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX】The fabrics of this Pillow are of the absolute Highest QUALITY and pass STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX! This pillow has a dust-proof and special breathable inner cover, which more effectively extends the service life of the memory foam core. This pillow equipment with a detachable outer pillowcase, durable, resilient and keep hygiene. It equipped with zipper, machine washable, you can always keep it clean and smelling fresh! 🎁 【A Perfect Thoughtful Gift】 With specially designed shape, Sufuhom memory foam cervical neck pillow is especially helpful to those restless sleepers who find it difficult to settle into one position for the night, like the stressed office worker, people who snore, and those suffering sleep disorders,etc. It is an excellent healthcare gift to show your care to somebody you concerned as a good night's sleep is essential to health and happiness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xtw8u7NUL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sufuhom","source_asin":"B09SHRT2QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHRT2QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHRT2QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
