window.products.push({"id":209574,"name":"Springerle rolling pin Springerle cookie molds Springerle cookies German cookies Springerle carved rolling pin,Christmas gifts,Gift for mom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xd3QnrCdL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a simple way to upgrade your cookies or pie crust, our rolling pins are here waiting for you with open arms. We at OmaMarta, made many trials and baked hundreds of different recipe cookies until we found the best patterns and created the best design for the engraved rolling pin to get well-embossed baking cookies. Exceptional craftsmanship and made with proper care, this patterned rolling pin will last for generations. This laser-cut high-quality bench wood rolling pin for making embossed cookies is cleaned and impregnated with a safe food oil. This material is durable, green, healthy, and environmentally friendly. Have in mind that, being a natural material, laser engravings perhaps change colors and small fissures. Large impression surface that will imprint multiple cookies on a single sheet of dough thus saving time on decorating. Use kids rolling pin on anything, sugar cookies, kid's dough, pasta, pastry, clay, icing, fondant, homemade noodles, and home play-dough. Treat yourself to quality patterned rolling pins for baking that could be quite versatile in kitchen. Engraved rolling pin for cookies are particularly good for rolling out doughs that require some extra hard work - like big batches of bread dough or chilled cookie dough. Special cookie dough recipes and instructions are included. Before using, brush it with vegetable oil or olive oil. Wash dry with a brush first, then if needed with water, and soap, and dry well before using again! Dry it thoroughly and apply a layer of vegetable oil. Great Christmas rolling pin gift for a mom, wife, or anyone who loves classical floral designs. This is a wonderful unique kitchen gift for family or friends who love to bake. Make it a fun activity for the whole family and especially for the kids, as these decorative floral rolling pins will bring your beautiful cookies alive . Order one now! Rolling pin size: total length: 14.96 inc /38.00 cm Working length: 7.08 inc / 18.00 cm Diameter: 2,35 inc /6.00 cm Weight: 450 gr Estimated shipping times: processing time 3 - 5 business day Europe: 5-10 business days USA and Canada: 10-14 business days Australia, New Zealand: 2-4 weeks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xd3QnrCdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OmaMarta","source_asin":"B07W3FZ3HT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W3FZ3HT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W3FZ3HT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
