window.products.push({"id":209675,"name":"Meriville Lione 1-Inch Diameter Single Window Treatment Curtain Rod, Crystal Finial, 28-inch to 48-inch Adjustable, Satin Nickel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61coXhm+QlL._AC_SL1329_.jpg","description":"STURDY AND DURABLE: Meriville 1” diameter Lione crystal adjustable curtain rods are made of metal so you know they will last. COMPLETE WINDOW ROD SET: Includes rods, crystal finials, brackets and mounting hardware. EXTENDABLE: Designed to fit a range of window sizes. Come in three sizes: 28\" - 48\", 48\" - 84\" and 84\" - 120\". Two adjustable brackets included in 28\"-48\" rod set; three adjustable brackets included in 48\"-84\" and 84\"-120\" rod sets. Projection from wall adjusts from 4\" to 5.5”. MORE FINISH CHOICES: Available in 3 finishes: Black, Antique Brass and Satin nickel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61coXhm+QlL._AC_SL1329_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MERIVILLE","source_asin":"B078K2SZZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078K2SZZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078K2SZZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209676,"name":"Goging Adjustable Curved Shower Rod Expandable Rustproof Aluminum Alloy Shower Rod 43.3\" to 70.8\"Telescoping Design Exquisite Wall Mount Shower Curtai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FJ-LBiKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a rustproof,simple and easy-to-install curved shower curtain rod? Features: 1. Crafted with rust-resistant steel,high strength,no rust. 2. Included screws and mounting hardware ensure an easy and quick installation. 3. Freely stretchable length from 43.3\" to 70.8\",meets different needs for different space. 4. Easy to install,practical and durable.Wall attachments protect your walls from scratches and keep the shower rod in good place. 5. Curved Shower Curtain Rod is the perfect shower rod to use in small spaces.It is perfect for Bathroom Corner,Bathtub Corner,Perpendicular walls corner,Apartment Cloakrooms Corner,Reading Corner and more. Here are some using suggestions for the types of walls: ①The shower rod can stretch the length from 43.3\" to 70.8\",but please avoid the longest length,which will make it easier to fall.You can adjust the best length to fit your shower space,then use accessories to install the shower curtain rod to the wall. ②Our curved shower curtain rod can be used in two types of walls,one is vertical corner wall,the other is between two parallel walls. ③The base is rotatable.The stand cup has one side high and the other low.You need to put the low side inside and then install it to the wall. (Note:If you put the high side inside then the base cannot be rotated and fixed to the wall.) ④The shower curtain rod has a certain carrying capacity,which can handle a lot of fabrics.But never put overloaded heavy objects so as not to damage the shower curtain rod. If you have any dissatisfaction with our shower curtain rod or if it gets damaged during shipment or transportation, please feel free to contact us,we will try our best to solve the problem soon. Note: Due to limited telescopic range of the shower curtain rod,its coverage is not suitable for too large space.Please confirm the size of your bathroom space before purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FJ-LBiKhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goging","source_asin":"B08HJVXBPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HJVXBPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HJVXBPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
