window.products.push({"id":209786,"name":"Nonstick Cookware Set by EZICO, 5 Pieces, Kitchen Pots & Pans Sets Includes 9.5” Frying Pans, 9.5” Stock Pots, and 1.5qt Saucepans Organizer. Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P3m1NsRhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"EASY & COLORFUL COOKING - Providing colorful and handy cookware to the world.This cookware set 5 piece included- 1.5qt Saucepan with lid, 9.5 inch frying pan and 9.5 inch Square frying pan with lid. COOKWARE SET of 5 Pieces -Includes 1.5 qt saucepan with lid, 9.5 inch frying pan and 9.5 inch Square frying pan with lid. NON-STICK - Nonstick cookware set ensures the ultimate food cooking experience - everything just slides right off the pan, even with less oil or butter. Clean up easily. HEATS QUICKLY - EZICO pots and pans are made of professional grade aluminum that heat quickly with precise temperature control induction. CARE INSTRUCTION: We RECOMAND Hand-washing: Always wait for your cookware to cool before cleaning. EZICO cookware is easy to clean in warm, soapy water using a cloth or sponge. Never use abrasive cleaners or scouring pads such as steel wool, scouring powder or oven cleaner. Stubborn spots can be removed with cleaners that specify “safe for non-stick surfaces.” When cleaning glass lids, do not use metal scouring pads or harsh abrasives, as they may scratch and weaken the glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P3m1NsRhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZICO","source_asin":"B09FYCDBW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FYCDBW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FYCDBW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
