window.products.push({"id":209898,"name":"HUANGYIFU Small Natural Wooden Sushi Serving Tray Plate Boat-Display Boat-1piece-33/37/42cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z1hHb1XYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About us --- HUANGYIFU Bamboo/Wood steamer originated in the Song Dynasty,invented by the Ningde China People Huang Yi Fu who was born in 1082,nearly a thousand years of tradition.The Steamers are favored by people with lightweight, non-toxic, healthier.Our handcraft successfully applied to become Intangible Cultural Heritage.As 31th generation inheritors, we keeping the hand-made technique and innovation,to produce more excellent crafts,and registered own trademark of \"Huang Yi Fu\" for them,we want to introduce our high quality,anthentic Chinese cookware to you.Begin to experience the charm of \"Steaming\" ! Product description: Brand name:HUANGYIFU Place of original:Ningde,the hometown of bamboo in Fujian Province,China Size:33/37/42cm or 13/14.5/16.5inch Material:Wood Technology: Color Glaze Daily maintain: ❶Because heat makes wood expand and cold makes it contract,the sushi boat can’t be basked or blowed by cold wind. ❷If the sushi boat is heavy oil after serving meat,it can be washed by trace amounts of detergent and warm water. ❸If the sushi boat is smelly,clean it with lemon and crude salt ❹Don’t put the raw food and cooked food together, avoid food bacteria cross breeding After buying: If you have any questions, please email me at any time, we will answer all your questions as soon as possible, thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z1hHb1XYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUANGYIFU","source_asin":"B06XZ2CTRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZ2CTRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZ2CTRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
