window.products.push({"id":209935,"name":"Silicone Muffin Pan 6 Cup, European LFGB Silicone Cupcake Baking Pan - Set of 2, Non-Stick Muffin Tins, LFGB Approved Egg Muffin Tray, Food-Grade Muff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tx5sEs1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE OF TOP-LEVEL PROFESSIONAL SILICONE - In order to ensure food safety,Aokinle silicone cupcake baking cups is made of high quality LFGB and BPA Free Food Grade silicone.No odor, safe and stable performance. European LFGB Silicone is stricter standard and worry-free. Pinching the silicone turns no white. PROFESSIONAL FOR BAKING MUFFIN - Silicone muffin pan has 6 cup（Each Cup Size:2.75 inch. dia. x 1.25 inch）, Pan Size: 10.63inch x 7.08inch x 1.2inch. Compared to the 12 cup muffin pan, this silicone mold is more stable after food full. Designed for baking Muffin,Mini cake and more. NON-STICK SILICONE BAKING PAN - Non-stick,reusable and flexible. Compared to the hard molds, this silicone muffin pan is flexible, so just pop out cakes with pressed finger, naturally non-stick for quick release, easily cleanup.Say goodbye to soaking and scrubbing metal bakeware forever. HIGH TEMPERATURE RESISTANCE,ANTI-FREEZING,SAFE TO USE - The silicone baking mold is safe used in oven, microwave oven, freezer and dishwasher. The temperature safe from -40℃ to 230℃ (-40℉ to 446℉) HIGH QUALITY GUARANTEE - We always aim at providing best product and top service for every buyer friends and. If there is any problem with the product, please contact us within 30 days and we will give you rechange or return and full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tx5sEs1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aokinle","source_asin":"B0B1CT9Q65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1CT9Q65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1CT9Q65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209936,"name":"Handcrafted Model Ships Antique Brass Admiral Sign - Brass Wall Sign - Nautical Brass Sign - Beach Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gxf9gCeYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ideal for posting on a boat, in a boathouse, or any nautical themed room, this brass Admiral sign 6 inch is a must have for any commander in chief. Handcrafted from solid brass with an antique brass finish and a stylish brass framing, this beautifully shining sign has a classy nautical appeal with bold and clear lettering on an antique brass face.NOTE: Wall mounting hardware not included. Elegant Solid brass design Antique brass finish Handcrafted with precise detail Textured solid brass background Sign requires two screws for easy mounting (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gxf9gCeYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handcrafted Model Ships","source_asin":"B00MEZGERC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MEZGERC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MEZGERC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209937,"name":"Jahoot Blackout Window Film, Upgraded 100% Light Blocking Glass Tint Static Cling Window Cover for Privacy, Stop UV, Nap Time, Room Darkening & Day Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710mOx8QXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Total Black Out The window tint offers a total privacy option, blocking 100% of vision on both sides of the glazing. The blackout shades will block 100% of light, to make the room darkening. It is an ideal choice for babies, toddlers or shift workers who need to sleep during daytime hours. 2019 Upgraded We value user reviews and update the design to make it easier for everyone to install and use it. And our new film has 25% more length per roll than other brands. Allows to cover larger or more windows. Tips: 1, Always put the film on the inside of window and only apply it to smooth glass surfaces.2, Affix tape on a corner of the backside to quickly remove the clear backing.3, For best results, do not apply film in direct sunlight or during freezing weather.4, For light leakage at edges of some old windows, use black electrical tape or silicone caulk or similar things to seal the edges.5, Please remember to take caution when handling the film as the slightest fold will create a permanent wrinkle.6, Don't apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. Don't know how to use it? Don't worry, the static cling film is very easy to apply! Step 1. Keep Window or Glass cleanStep 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water. (Soapy water will be better) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect sheet, and then the smooth side should be post to the window. Step 4. When you install it, Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 6. Much easier than Wall Decals, it's no problem for you. Step 7. Enjoy your works! GENUINE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Contact us anytime via Amazon for a free refund or replacement, no question asked, no return necessary! For any product related questions or concerns, just let us know and we'll endeavor to respond within 24hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710mOx8QXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jahoot","source_asin":"B07NV8KJXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NV8KJXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NV8KJXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209938,"name":"Biscaynebay Extra Long Textured Fabric Shower Curtains 72\" Width by 84\" Length, Silver Grey Morocco Pearl Printed Bathroom Curtains Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91x2mQJo3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Printed polyester fabric is special woven, textured with slubs. Lights can get through partly, providing romantic atmosphere. 100% superior quality and Eco-friendly polyester, long life use. Suitable for families and upscale hotels. Made of 125gsm durable premium polyester fabric. 72 Inch Width by 84 Inch Height to fit standard tubs and showers, with 12 button holes in the head and a weighted hem at the whole bottom. Machine wash cold with mild detergent; Use non-chlorine bleach. Tumble dry low and remove promptly. Wrinkle and fade Resistant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91x2mQJo3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biscaynebay","source_asin":"B07Z48ZR87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z48ZR87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z48ZR87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209939,"name":"Valhalla Shield Ax Throwing Oak Barrel Bar Sign Personalized Custom Authentic Whiskey Barrel Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QAk3gnvTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Theme: Valhalla Shield Ax Throwing Oak Barrel Bar Sign Personalized Custom Wall Art Each Barrel Head is Unique in its own design, no two are the same. Whiskey Barrel Bar Signs are made using Authentic wood barrel lids from your favorite Bourbon Whiskey Makers you'll usually see the Makers Marks Stamped Right on Them. Whiskey Barrel Bar Signs are the Perfect Bar Decor for your Home Bar and make the Perfect GiftsPURPOSE: Authentic Bourbon Barrel Heads Make great Wall Decor signs. Barrel Lids are great for the Man Cave, Garage, Basement, Bar Decor, Tavern or Pub. Whiskey Barrels Lids are approximately 22 inches in size and come from original aged charred barrels. They are the perfect gift for Groomsmen, for Poker night with friends in your Home Bar, in the Garage, Workshop or Man Cave. Whether you love whiskey, bourbon, beer, wine, Rum or Tequila this is the perfect sign for you!HISTORY: Whiskey Barrels come directly from the Kentucky Bourbon and Tennessee Whiskey Distilleries to us so you'll likely see the Makers Marks of the distillery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QAk3gnvTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rustic Home Wall Art","source_asin":"B08BY6XV1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BY6XV1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BY6XV1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209940,"name":"Hanover 12-Liter / 3.2-Gallon Black 12 Liter / 3.2 Gallon Hands Free Garbage Bin, Fingerprint Resistant, Soft Close, Sensor Lid, 12L Trash Can 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VABR-qIHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your waste disposal receptacle with the sleek convenience of a motion-activated trash can from Hanover. The 12-liter size is perfect for bathrooms, bedrooms, and other small spaces. A smudge-proof finish keeps the can looking shiny and new no matter what. You don't even have to worry about touching the bin and potentially spreading germs with the sensor-activated open and close lid. With the motion of a hand, the lid opens just long enough for you to throw away trash and closes 5 seconds after. A stay open mode is also able to be engaged when needed. There's nothing worse than your trash bag falling into the pail, so this model features an inner pail that keeps the bag in place. Trash removal is an unavoidable facet of life, so make it easier with all the convenient features of a Hanover trash can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VABR-qIHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hanover","source_asin":"B0C441LXB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C441LXB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C441LXB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
