window.products.push({"id":209973,"name":"changnoi 16x16 Fair Trade Throw Pillow Cover, Hmong Tribal Embroidered Cushion Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1hyIpH-ocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful cushion is made with an amazing piece of fabric woven by the HMONG hill tribes of Lanna Country (Northern Thailand). Put this lovely pillow on your bed, your sofa or your favourite armchair - it will make them look interestingly exotic!We buy materials from Hmong market and we design and sew by hand. Some of the bags we modify to improve the product. The Hmong tribes live in the North of Thailand and have origins from the Tibetan area of China. Care Instructions:  Wash on Delicate Cycle (or handwash for optimal care) Hang to dry  Important: Due to the nature of this artisanal product, there may be slight differences in colors and patterns.  Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings.  Please allow +-5cm as the error range for manual measure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1hyIpH-ocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"changnoi","source_asin":"B078JC9WG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JC9WG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JC9WG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":209974,"name":"Kardiel Monroe Mid-Century Modern Armchair, Canyon Aniline Premium Leather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lU7DQY+PL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Børge Mogensen created the original 2211 for his own home in Gentofte Denmark in 1962. This premium quality reproduction of the 2211 Armchair features a solid ash legs and hardwood frame graciously lined with polyurethane foam. The surface is luxuriously soft to the touch, compliments of its premium 100% Top-Grain Aniline leather upholstery. The design goes a bit further than the classic mid century modern cube shape. The body has an airy feel about it as it suspends over 4 architecturally square solid ash legs. Its comfortably proportioned size and lofty, fitted cushions line the seat, back and sides. Collectors of modernism pieces seek out the 2211 series for not only exceptional midcentury modern design, it is a practical seating experience for everyday use. * Style: 1 Seat Armchair. Inspired by Børge Mogensen. * Frame: Traditional Solid Ash hardwood box frame construction * Seat Platform: Reinforced bottom seat cushion platform for firm longer lasting support * Foam Type: Lofty, multi-density foam seat, side and back cushions provide comfort and cushion memory * Seat Cushion Style: Fitted removable seat, back and arm cushions * Cushion feature: Zippered back and seat cushions * Stitch Edge Type: Piping in Top Grain Premium Soft Aniline Leather * Leather Type: 100% upholstered in Genuine Top Grain Premium Soft Aniline Leather * Dimension: Height 29.92″ x Depth 32.67″ x Width 37.4″ * Dimension: Floor to seat height 18.11″ * Dimension:: Floor to arm height 26″ * Leg Type: True to original square wood leg, 5.9” tall * Feature: The entire sofa is stitched and crafted by hand * Feature: Comes standard with floor protection caps on legs * Feature: Matching sofa (3 seat 2213) is available to complete your look * Warranty: 3 year limited warranty 100% Genuine Top Grain Premium Soft Aniline Leather This Børge Mogensen inspired series is upholstered in premium Top Grain Aniline European leather. This is a significant upgrade in leather options. Top Grain is the actual surface of the cowhide. While no one knows the actual number, a small percentage of furniture sold today is upholstered in Premium Top Grain Aniline leather. Some claim as low as 5%. Aniline dying describes one of the two processes in which color is applied to the leather with the dye penetrating the leather and extending beyond the surface, into the leather itself. For modern furniture requiring a clean aesthetic, Top Grain Aniline Leather is both “liquid vat” (deep penetrating) and surface dyed to achieve the main color selection and to conceal uneven tones and blemishes in the hide. Top grain aniline is the softest leather and naturally breaths well. Because Top Grain refers to the actual surface of the animal hide it presents a natural leather appearance you would expect. While it is true that raw Top Grain Aniline absorbs spills easier, Furniture grade Top Grain leather features a stain resistant treatment making it exceptional for everyday lower maintenance use. Although rare, nothing wears, looks or feels better than premium Aniline Top Grain leather. Over time it patinas and becomes more comfortable versus wearing out. “Split Grain” is the most common leather used on furniture. This reproduction of the Børge Mogensen 2213 sofa has been upgraded to Top Aniline leather and does not use Split Grain leather. Nonetheless, this paragraph will help explain the difference in quality and price between the leather types. Split Grain is the underside of the hide that has been separated from the surface or “top” of the hide. While defined as actual leather, Split Grain leather does not have the natural surface grain of the top of the cowhide. A topical layer of insoluble pigment is applied to the surface of split grain leather, which is then stamped or “grain embossed” to imitate the surface appearance of actual leather. This topical layer contains the color that the leather will be. About the Design: A common issue with mid century modern seating designs is lack of practical comfort. Often the cube shape and straight lines result in a stiff, harshly vertical seating experience. Some would point the Le Corbusier LC2 and LC3 sofa series as prime examples of a well-designed modernist cube style with uncomfortable, impractical everyday use. The true genius of the 2213 (221 being the series and 3 indicating the numbers of cushion seats) is not only in the design but in its comfort. Mogensen created the series in 1962 for everyday use in his own home in Gentofte Denmark, about 20 minutes north of Copenhagen. The original still sits in the home today, between 2 end tables that were specifically created to fit on either end of the 2213. One of the differences you will find in the design of the 2213 from that of a typical mid century cube shape is the arms are slightly lower than the height of the back. As the arms near the back, they gently curve upward to meet the back height. The side frame that creates the arms is decisively narrow in form. Additional shape ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lU7DQY+PL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B00N67HFRA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-209974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N67HFRA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N67HFRA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
